OL,3,GNEWSASelf-driving shuttles aid fans    
OL,4,Awhile lift is fixed                    
OL,6,FA trial of self-driving shuttle buses  
OL,7,Fhas been expanded to transport football
OL,8,Fsupporters with disabilities and       
OL,9,Fmobility issues while a lift is broken 
OL,10,Fat a stadium.                          
OL,12,FThe service takes MK Dons fans from a  
OL,13,Fcar park pick-up and drop-off area to  
OL,14,Ftheir entry point at Stadium MK in     
OL,15,FMilton Keynes.                         
OL,17,FFans who usually enter via Gate Seven, 
OL,18,Fwhere the broken lift is, are now using
OL,19,Fother entrances. Wheelchair user Antony
OL,20,FYates said the shuttle meant he could  
OL,21,Favoid having to navigate the "big hill"
OL,22,Fleading to Gate One.                   
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
