OL,3,GNEWSASelf-driving shuttles aid fans    
OL,4,Awhile lift is fixed                    
OL,6,FThe former bus driver said the shuttle 
OL,7,F"takes a little bit of getting used    
OL,8,Fto", but there was a safety driver on  
OL,9,Fboard to reassure and assist people.   
